            name="summary"
        >Saskatchewan rates 10.5%, 12.5% and 14.5% from 54,532 and 155,805 (KP 1,091 and 4,207); basic personal amount 20,381, indexed at 2.0% and raised by 500 a year for four taxation years by The Saskatchewan Affordability Act; labour-sponsored funds credit LCP of 17.5% of the shares withheld, at most 875 a year.</field>
