            name="url"
        >https://www.wcbsask.com/policy-and-procedure/employer-premium-payments-pol-252025</field>
        <field
            name="summary"
        >Assessable earnings: gross earnings before deductions, up to the maximum of the year. Industry premium rate: a dollar amount per 100 of assessable payroll. Premiums of 5 or more are payable on the statement of account, due 30 days after it and/or on April 1 and September 1 depending on the annual assessment.</field>
